# Raised well past the other kingdoms' own ~0.0025-0.003 -- per direct
# instruction to sell an "endless ocean," the open water needs to fade to
# an indistinct horizon haze a few hundred units out (roughly 95% fogged by
# ~250m), long before OceanKingdomWrap's own 900-unit edge, so the actual
# boundary/teleport is never visually legible.
